 "structural_change": "SUCCESSOR of the flat per-quarter SU programme tile (hbm_su_pslice_r3_1017 gate FAIL 8058137fc: TT clock insertion 851..1280 ps, spread 429, GRT 4 h timeout; hbm_su_pslice_r4_1017 294f94bbd: TT 830..1148 ps, spread 318, GRT > 3.5 h with clock NDRs dropped, killed): one root over 98 SRAMs + 14k flops on 940 x 760 um. r5 = cluster ot_hbm_su_programme_pslice_c5: one leaf per command column (own packed 16-edge/row index, own dictionary, own 256 command flops, controller replica) + a head leaf (cfg stage + column decode + fault OR). Lockstep bench vs r4 on all 4 quarters PASS, mutants cfg/phase/cfgany/stale FAIL (db03bbcbd, results/rtl/hbm_su_lane_1017/r5_pgcol). Start advance unchanged DEPTH+4. THIS leaf: L master (3 per quarter): 4 index + 13 dictionary SRAMs, 302.4 x 453.6, MY stack dictionary 0..4 + index 0..3, R0 stack dictionary 5..12, one 34.8 um channel, N cfg band 41 um, S band = 256 command flops, ~3.3k flops one root.",
